blender-sml-stdlib 0.2.0

Minimal, parseable subset of the OMG SysML v2 standard library, pinned for the
Blender-SML bindings. Derived from the standard library shipped with sml2c
0.45.4-alpha; trimmed to what the pinned sml2c can parse and what the bindings
consume.

Contents:
  Geometry/  — ShapeItems (solid starter set) + SpatialItems, for the geometry
               binding (SCRUM-624). Maps to Blender mesh primitives.
  Time/      — Occurrences (Occurrence / snapshots / timeSlices) + Time (Clock /
               TimeInstant), for the animation binding (SCRUM-644). Maps to
               Blender keyframes / actions.
